# =============================================================================
# SECURITY: this repository is public. Nothing secret or device-unique may be
# committed. The rules below are a safety net, not a substitute for review:
# always run `git diff --cached` before committing.
#
# Never commit: private keys, CA seeds, join tokens, PINs, PUF activation codes,
# PUF key codes, board/device serial numbers, SPIRE server datastores.
# If a public cert or test fixture really must be committed, add a narrowly
# scoped `!path/to/file` exception with a comment explaining why it is safe.
# =============================================================================

# --- Key material and certificates (any format) ------------------------------
*.key
*.pem
*.der
*.crt
*.cer
*.csr
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.gpg
*.asc
id_rsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*

# --- Key ceremony outputs (seeds, paper-backup sources, shares) --------------
ceremony-out/
ceremony/**/out/
*.seed
*seed*.txt
*.shares
shares/
paper-backup*
!docs/**/paper-backup*.md

# --- SPIRE runtime state ------------------------------------------------------
# Join tokens are single-use bearer credentials for node attestation.
*.token
join-token*
join_token*
# SPIRE server/agent data dirs: datastore, disk KeyManager keys.json, agent SVID cache.
.data/
spire-data/
**/spire/data/
keys.json
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
agent_svid.der
bundle.der

# --- Board / secenclave device-unique data ------------------------------------------
# PUF activation codes and key codes are bound to one chip; still not for git.
*.ac
activation_code*
*keycode*
*key_code*
# Serial numbers, UIDs, provisioning dumps, CMPA/CFPA images.
*serial-number*
*serial_number*
serials.*
device-info*
*.uid
cmpa*.bin
cfpa*.bin
# PINs / passphrases / env files.
*.pin
*pin.txt
.env
.env.*
secrets/
!docs/**/secrets*.md

# --- Firmware build outputs (MCUXpresso / CMake / armgcc) ---------------------
build/
build_*/
armgcc/debug/
armgcc/release/
*.elf
*.axf
*.bin
*.hex
*.srec
*.map
*.o
*.a
*.d
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
.mcuxpressoide_packages_support/
.settings/

# --- Go -------------------------------------------------------------------------
/bin/
*.test
*.out
coverage.*
go.work.sum

# --- Editors / OS ----------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
